{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_036_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:371a6a57aa1cdcc48cc6d7be514b4b9146786a7ffd8ccffcf0615ed771247e34",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13e7a155ff2b5a166c0a6918d14b989abefec5d3dd0971481c1a23f2b7bf1fa6",
      "text": "今天我给●●●●プロデューサー酱\n带了gift过来哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:632d3c4c00da56257ef36084a7ed26aa09f609f260a241d5263f89594f4743a9",
      "text": "锵锵——！这是情人节的回礼哦！\n上个月不是送了我chocolate嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb59d5d1237c98d46553e07bd7b4fe9294a18cad8d1d42ba3b31db135157f1f",
      "text": "虽然听说White day的回礼是3倍来着？\n不过我可是塞进了100倍的心意哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b457c47be5290f7eb4f6ab260c6641ddf30276c27cb3cd6280d5b1099012619f",
      "text": "我想你肯定也会喜欢的☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0add8ce58d011e524b5e02fd521a04d4ec402c61bcd75d9c4354bdc1eaedb1d",
      "text": "愿意收下吗？\n●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ba0ea765bf044a22c3e1727e6b9f9aa460f7f818a41cf44bd06a94df8c5a03",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，这边这边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5277368600ef81aebf68b07a45fdd46afea0489cb054115a43b0ddded378b56e",
      "text": "今天的工作也辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d050b6d3d7941fac219fc0251c71de7f6ed4fb0a0a681bb7f7bef62eb5451f60",
      "text": "还有，happy white day！\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:538bb9445a575eae353d07262b93ecab61e32625af89b49ae3cffd61be23173f",
      "text": "Valentine's day多亏了收到的chocolate，\n让我体会到了sweet又happy的心情哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db0cc6ad4a86964755b28148c9f231ada4c424c8c3126c75f315677c8a080383",
      "text": "当时promise过的谢礼，我准备好啦！\n愿意收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000050:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbfb68351803cde160e8f5f8242f345d001be0dac1b99f20ca4d3032189ad1fe",
      "text": "超级开心！非常感谢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000051:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e592037dd8d337e6b31626aa7cefa37118465a3bae6326e769790d7954e7faf",
      "text": "当然！请允许我欣然收下",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:339adcf2d425bab32df5030151704416e616bd7008eea74470ccb2a8cb767f7f",
      "text": "太好了。看到你的smile，\n连我都会变得happy起来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:071a512467b82cddbb586d26c1b600c9719e781db8cfcfab0719518dcd25ceee",
      "text": "大概是因为共同度过的时间很多，\n所以已经能够share彼此的心情了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_036_22:5_02_036_22_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:494fcac4283f89439ada1aeea5b0335be5c48f3347a10dbf7787e2e967fd0108",
      "text": "今后两个人也要一起度过happy的时光哦。\n●●●●プロデューサー酱☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
